{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783095841646,"sessionID":"ses_0d73761b4ffeeYMCfmt4qmo4gg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8f6f371033742e61","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{
  "summary": "铜锁（Tongsuo）是由开放原子开源基金会孵化和运营的开源基础密码库，基于 OpenSSL 3.x 分支深度扩展，提供中国商用密码算法（SM2/SM3/SM4/祖冲之）、国际主流算法（RSA/ECDSA/AES/SHA）、同态加密（EC-ElGamal/Paillier）、零知识证明（Bulletproofs/NIZK）、后量子密码（ML-KEM/ML-DSA/SLH-DSA）以及安全通信协议（TLCP双证书国密/TLS 1.3+国密单证书/QUIC/Delegated Credentials）。铜锁已获得商用密码产品认证证书，广泛应用于支付宝、OceanBase、阿里云、Tengine、Angie 等产品。该库以 C 语言为核心，通过 Provider 架构组织算法实现，产出 libcrypto 和 libssl 两个共享库。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "中国商用密码算法",
      "description": "实现 SM2 数字签名与密钥交换、SM3 杂凑算法、SM4 分组密码、祖冲之（ZUC）序列密码等国密标准算法",
      "evidence": ["crypto/sm2/", "crypto/sm3/", "crypto/sm4/", "crypto/zuc/", "include/openssl/sm2_threshold.h", "include/openssl/sm3.h"]
    },
    {
      "name": "国际主流密码算法",
      "description": "实现 RSA/ECDSA/ECDH、AES、SHA-2/SHA-3、ChaCha20-Poly1305、DES 等国际标准算法",
      "evidence": ["crypto/rsa/", "crypto/ec/", "crypto/aes/", "crypto/sha/", "crypto/chacha/", "crypto/des/"]
    },
    {
      "name": "同态加密",
      "description": "实现 EC-ElGamal 加法同态加密和 Paillier 加法同态加密算法，支持密文域上的加法运算",
      "evidence": ["crypto/paillier/", "crypto/ec/ec_elgamal.c", "include/openssl/paillier.h", "apps/ec_elgamal.c", "apps/paillier.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "零知识证明",
      "description": "实现 Bulletproofs 范围证明与 R1CS 证明、NIZK 非交互零知识证明",
      "evidence": ["crypto/zkp/", "include/openssl/bulletproofs.h", "include/openssl/nizk.h", "apps/bulletproofs.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "后量子密码学",
      "description": "实现 ML-KEM (Kyber) 密钥封装、ML-DSA (Dilithium) 数字签名、SLH-DSA (SPHINCS+) 数字签名等后量子标准算法",
      "evidence": ["crypto/ml_kem/", "crypto/ml_dsa/", "crypto/slh_dsa/", "include/openssl/ml_kem.h"]
    },
    {
      "name": "安全通信协议",
      "description": "支持 GB/T 38636-2020 TLCP 双证书国密通信协议、RFC 8998 TLS 1.3+国密单证书、QUIC 协议 API、Delegated Credentials、TLS 证书压缩",
      "evidence": ["ssl/statem_ntls/", "include/openssl/ntls.h", "include/openssl/quic.h", "ssl/quic/", "ssl/ssl_dc.c"]
    },
    {
      "name": "密码学基础设施",
      "description": "提供 Provider 可插拔架构、ENGINE 引擎机制、BIO I/O 抽象层、X.509 证书处理、PKCS#12/PKCS#7 等密码学基础框架",
      "evidence": ["providers/", "crypto/engine/", "crypto/bio/", "crypto/x509/", "crypto/pkcs12/", "crypto/pkcs7/"]
    },
    {
      "name": "SDF 密码设备接口",
      "description": "支持国密 SDF（Security Device Function）密码设备接口，用于对接硬件密码机/密码卡",
      "evidence": ["crypto/sdf/", "include/openssl/sdf.h", "include/openssl/sgd.h", "apps/sdf.c"]
    }
  ],
  "domain": "cryptography",
  "target_users": "需要在产品中集成国密合规能力、TLS/QUIC 安全通信或高级密码学原语（同态加密/零知识证明/后量子）的开发者和企业"
}
